*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0045
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 601
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0045.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0045C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 FEE-WAIVED-2 VALUE 'Y'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM AGE-FEE-RULES
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
AGE-FEE-RULES.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 18 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y'
           AND CUSTOMER-AGE < 24
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO MTH-FEE
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 45 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN CUSTOMER-AGE >= 60
            SET FEE-WAIVED-2 TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO MTH-FEE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 9 TO MTH-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
